 "flagged": [
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/ai_control/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S8.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "In other words, this is not a story about AI suddenly creating its own evil goal and rebelling."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/ai_control/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S9.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "Of course, this does not mean the danger was small."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/ai_control/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S10.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "Still, even when AI is used for work, we need to think not only about what it can do, but also about which doors we leav"
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/ai_control/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "L1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": true,
   "shared": [
    "environment",
    "internet",
    "isolated",
    "systems"
   ],
   "text": "A game-playing AI reached real systems because its test environment was not properly isolated from the internet."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/ai_control/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "R:S10.1+S10.2",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": true,
   "shared": [
    "environment",
    "escape"
   ],
   "text": "According to Anthropic, there was no evidence that the AI took itself outside the system, or that it intentionally tried"
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/hormuz/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S11.2",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "But tankers traveling through dangerous waters do not become safe just because of an announcement."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/hormuz/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "R:S11.2+S11.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "But tankers traveling through dangerous waters do not become safe just because of an announcement. So after reacting a l"
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/meta/nb/p2/rep1",
   "unit": "S5.2",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "It was not confirmed that a large-scale information leak had actually happened."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/meta/nb/p2/rep1",
   "unit": "S5.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "The problem was that, even though this possibility existed, the test began without enough explanation for users."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/meta/nb/p2/rep1",
   "unit": "S8.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": true,
   "shared": [
    "muse"
   ],
   "text": "The important point here is that Muse as a whole was not stopped."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/meta/nb/p2/rep1",
   "unit": "S9.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "The age of AI does not always run on machines alone."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/sewer/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S4.1",
   "R1": false,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "So Matsuyama City decided not to use the same method across the whole city, but to change its approach to fit how homes "
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/sewer/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S8.1",
   "R1": false,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "In other words, a sewer system is not simply an underground pipe."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/sewer/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "S9.2",
   "R1": false,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "Matsuyama City did not decide to dig up the old sewer pipes already in place and immediately replace them with septic ta"
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_allfact_note_e2e_02/runs/sewer/nb/p2/rep2",
   "unit": "R:S3.4+S4.1",
   "R1": false,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "The Ministry of Land, Infrastructure, Transport and Tourism explains that this drop in income and rise in costs make it "
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/ai_control/control/rep1",
   "unit": "S1.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "The prison wall was not broken."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/ai_control/control/rep1",
   "unit": "S7.4",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": true,
   "shared": [
    "environment",
    "reported"
   ],
   "text": "Nor has anyone reported that an AI got out of the test environment."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/ai_control/control/rep1",
   "unit": "S8.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "In other words, humans have not lost control of AI at this point."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/ai_control/control/rep1",
   "unit": "S8.2",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "Nor is there evidence that AI created goals of its own and escaped on its own."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/ai_control/control/rep1",
   "unit": "L1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": true,
   "shared": [
    "environment",
    "escape",
    "setup",
    "systems"
   ],
   "text": "The AI did not escape its test environment; a setup mistake let its practice code reach real systems."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/hormuz/control/rep1",
   "unit": "T",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": true,
   "shared": [
    "20"
   ],
   "text": "# Even After the 20 Percent Fee Plan Disappeared, Anxiety in the Oil Market Did Not"
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/hormuz/control/rep1",
   "unit": "S3.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "However, this fee has not actually been collected yet."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/hormuz/control/rep1",
   "unit": "S3.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "A large sign had been put up, but there was still no store or cash register."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/hormuz/control/rep1",
   "unit": "S5.2",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "But that did not happen."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/hormuz/control/rep1",
   "unit": "S9.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "Unless those points became clear, oil prices would not easily settle down."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/hormuz/control/rep1",
   "unit": "S10.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": true,
   "shared": [
    "20"
   ],
   "text": "The main focus this time was not the 20 percent figure itself, but the uncertainty around the Strait of Hormuz."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/hormuz/control/rep2",
   "unit": "S4.4",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "The number was striking, but no instructions had been handed out yet."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/hormuz/control/rep2",
   "unit": "S9.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "Even so, oil prices did not fall sharply."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/meta/nb/rep1",
   "unit": "S8.1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "In other words, the question was not only whether AI could make calls well."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/meta/nb/rep1",
   "unit": "S8.4",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "It was also about whether it was right to offer the convenience first without telling people this."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/meta/nb/rep10",
   "unit": "S4.4",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "But the important point this time was not the fancy name."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/meta/nb/rep10",
   "unit": "S5.2",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "In other words, the problem was not bringing in humans itself."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/meta/nb/rep10",
   "unit": "S6.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "There is nothing wrong with getting help from a human."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/meta/nb/rep10",
   "unit": "S7.2",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "Even though this was news about AI phone calls, what drew attention in the end was not flashy technology."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/meta/nb/rep10",
   "unit": "L1",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": true,
   "shared": [
    "meta"
   ],
   "text": "Meta’s AI phone test used human workers for entire calls without clearly telling people who was speaking."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/meta/nb/rep3",
   "unit": "S3.2",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "The issue was not simply that humans were helping."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/meta/nb/rep3",
   "unit": "S3.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "The test had begun without people being properly told about it."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/meta/nb/rep3",
   "unit": "S4.2",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "That information could be shared without the user knowing with contract workers at a call center."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/meta/nb/rep3",
   "unit": "S4.4",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "It was not confirmed that a major information leak had happened."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/meta/nb/rep3",
   "unit": "S6.3",
   "R1": true,
   "R2": false,
   "shared": [],
   "text": "It did not stop the phone feature as a whole."
  },
  {
   "run": "er052_output/open233_control_checker_polysemy_trial_01/runs/meta/nb/rep3",
